---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing" description="Pricing for Rainbowfern: fixed-scope offers, sessions and a sliding scale, all in one place.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-heading">Pricing</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Every price on this site lives on this page. Fixed-scope offers have a starting price. Sessions have a fixed price. Mentoring uses a sliding scale.</p>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="offers-heading">
    <h2 id="offers-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Fixed-scope offers</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
      <li class="rounded-lg bg-card p-5 shadow-paper ring-1 ring-line">
        <p class="text-ink-soft">Codebase Map: from [PRICE TBD].</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-lg bg-card p-5 shadow-paper ring-1 ring-line">
        <p class="text-ink-soft">Small-business systems: from [PRICE TBD], on a sliding scale.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="sessions-heading">
    <h2 id="sessions-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Sessions</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Unstuck session, 60 minutes: [PRICE TBD]. 90 minutes: [PRICE TBD]. Paid when you book.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="scale-heading">
    <h2 id="scale-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Sliding scale</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Mentoring has a standard rate and a floor: standard [PRICE TBD], floor [PRICE TBD]. The same quality at every rate. I don't ask about income or identity.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Pay what your situation allows. You'll get the same work either way.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">The lowest tier is the solidarity rate: [PRICE TBD].</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="capacity-heading">
    <h2 id="capacity-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Capacity</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">[TBD: honest capacity line, e.g. 'I take two solidarity-rate projects at a time; 1 open now.']</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="allocation-heading">
    <h2 id="allocation-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Where the money goes</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">[TBD: fee-allocation note, optional. Only if Astrid wants to publish it.]</p>
  </section>

  <p class="mt-12 text-ink-soft">
    Not sure which one fits? <a href="/contact" class="text-accent hover:underline inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">Start with the contact page.</a>
  </p>
</Layout>
